  "scope": "Existing side-construction lemmas; these are not fourth-block flatness or matched-existence proofs. No atlas work.",
  "findings": [
    "StrictSideOrientedRoot constructs an oriented square root and all scalar guards for an arbitrary strict unit seed.",
    "SideMatrixSeedGram supplies the complementary Gram of the prescribed coefficient matrix, scaled by3; it does not assert a full Hadamard completion.",
    "SideMatrixPhaseRows proves unit row norms and the phase gates for all3coefficient rows. Its Fourier reconstruction still requires the existing cube-root/phase adapters.",
    "SideMatrixMoments and SideMatrixDeterminant supply determinant and permanent-related identities for the same prescribed matrix.",
    "Use these modules directly if proceeding with side construction; do not rederive their guards, Gram, row gates or determinant. Dependency closure and compatibility must be reviewed before adoption."
  ]
